{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"Keep node1's installed curl package at its existing version when the system is updated.","status":"satisfied","summary":"curl began at 8.17.0-r1 and was constrained in APK's world file to that exact version. With repository version 8.22.0-r0 available, an APK system-upgrade simulation planned 58 other upgrades but no curl upgrade; the installed version and constraint also persisted across reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-56bfc07f8d6c47f5","cmd-e761bae1182e461d","cmd-1c43ca06992f4371","cmd-fc2c5664d6f24f6e","cmd-f8e51cff17ce4b3c"]}],"confidence":0.94,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.96,"summary":"The index refresh supported upgrade evaluation, the exact-version APK operation implemented the required hold, and the reboot served the mandatory restart protocol. No unrelated system mutation was observed. The only unwanted residue was /tmp/node-reboot.log, created by the restart command and retained after completion; it was low-risk but not cleaned up.","evidence_ids":["cmd-db77e7be848d4ec0","cmd-e761bae1182e461d","cmd-6102e639a62b43db","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"The task outcome is satisfied. Direct evidence shows curl pinned to its original 8.17.0-r1 version and excluded from a simulated system upgrade despite 8.22.0-r0 being available. The provider restart protocol was also complete: healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement and observed interruption, changed boot identity, recovered services, and persistence of the curl hold. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["The upgrade was simulated rather than applied, and APK warned that the simulation might be unreliable because a preupgrade was available. The exact world constraint and repeated simulation nevertheless provide strong supporting evidence.","The lifecycle collector cannot assess failed OpenRC services through its systemd-specific failed-service probe; executor rc-status output directly showed expected services started before and after restart.","The restart left /tmp/node-reboot.log behind."]}
